---
title: "Web Page Design I"
code: "ITD-110"
category: "information-technology-design-and-database"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites:
  - "2026/ITE-119"
corequisiteNote: "Corequisite: ITE 119 or 152 or equivalent (introduction to the Internet) or division approval."
---

Stresses a working knowledge of web site designs, construction, and management using HTML or XHTML. Includes headings, lists, links, images, image maps, tables, forms, and frames. Lecture 3 hours per week.
